### Feature Ingredient — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ingredients/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### UPDATE (PUT)
# @name updateIngredientPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ingredients/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ING-001",
  "name": "Tomate Actualizado",
  "unitOfMeasure": "kg",
  "minimumStock": 10
}

### UPDATE (PATCH)
# @name updateIngredientPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ingredients/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minimumStock": 10
}
